D NVDAX,TSLAX,AAPLX,GOOGLX,SPCX,SP500           Thanksgiving Day\n2026-11-27 18:00:00+00:00 NYSE_EARLY_CLOSE NVDAX,TSLAX,AAPLX,GOOGLX,SPCX,SP500     Day after Thanksgiving\n2026-12-24 18:00:00+00:00 NYSE_EARLY_CLOSE NVDAX,TSLAX,AAPLX,GOOGLX,SPCX,SP500              Christmas Eve\n2026-12-25 14:30:00+00:00      NYSE_CLOSED NVDAX,TSLAX,AAPLX,GOOGLX,SPCX,SP500              Christmas Day\n2027-01-01 14:30:00+00:00      NYSE_CLOSED NVDAX,TSLAX,AAPLX,GOOGLX,SPCX,SP500             New Year's Day\n2027-01-18 14:30:00+00:00      NYSE_CLOSED NVDAX,TSLAX,AAPLX,GOOGLX,SPCX,SP500 Martin Luther King Jr. Day\nresult columns ['miner_uid', 'scored_time', 'crps', 'asset', 'start_time', 'time_increment', 'time_length', 'miner_id', 'detail_1min', 'detail_2min', 'detail_5min', 'detail_15min', 'detail_30min', 'detail_60min_abs', 'detail_Gaps', 'detail_vol_60min', 'detail_vol_15min', 'detail_vol_5min', 'detail_Vol', 'detail_Overall']\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_208","type":"agent_message","text":"Two findings are clear enough to act on: robust five-minute seasonal profiles help commodities and equities, while giving individual weekdays more weight hurts. Removing past event shocks from volatility estimates also failed to help ordinary-day forecasts. I’m keeping the successful checkpoint fixed and testing whether predicting how volatility changes through the forecast horizon adds a more durable gain."}}
