{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_276","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"uv run python - <<'PY'\nfrom pathlib import Path\np=Path('agent/journal.md')\np.write_text(p.read_text()+'''\\\\n### Sampling edge case\\\\n\\\\nThe first odd-count/seed audit exposed a degenerate one-path case: rank-stratifying a single Sobol coordinate always gives the median, making every shock zero regardless of seed. Counts and shape were valid, but this made the one-path process unrepresentative. Preserve the scrambled raw Sobol coordinate when N=1; rank stratification remains unchanged for N>1. This fix does not alter any 1000-path CRPS result. Re-run the audit at 1, 3, 999, 1000 and 1001 paths.\\\\n''')\nPY\"","aggregated_output":"","exit_code":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
