1253242132048273 None\nSaved volatility_86400_2026-08-01.pt epochs 2 past log RMSE 0.21855893877853433 export difference 0.0\nFit 2026-10-01 3600 rows 57590 train 54230 valid 3350\nprobe 1 0.07616579012937394 0.0656421536118237\nprobe 10 0.06944065843448634 0.0641764990963153\nprobe 20 0.06838659759450834 0.0636876029398904\nprobe 30 0.06761500140287638 0.06347672647504664\nprobe 40 0.06688714474851787 0.06369435780083955\nrefit 1 0.07569787093600086 None\nrefit 10 0.0690452095883798 None\nrefit 20 0.06811140834389927 None\nrefit 30 0.06739511598334334 None\nHYPE    3600 2026-11-08 CRPS=1163.97616 n=84 s/prompt=0.041\ncrypto24: mean CRPS=4187.761346, n=1680\nother24: mean CRPS=2313.083746, n=2688\ncrypto1: mean CRPS=875.098438, n=1680\nRunning separate_half; budget checked.\nHYPE    3600 2026-11-08 CRPS=1163.21387 n=84 s/prompt=0.039\ncrypto24: mean CRPS=4178.270910, n=1680\nother24: mean CRPS=2304.734732, n=2688\ncrypto1: mean CRPS=873.642388, n=1680\nRunning integrated_sv; budget checked.\nRunning sobol_rank_bridge_precision_641\ncrypto1: mean CRPS=875.128568, n=1680\nRunning sobol_rank_bridge_mix_precision_641\ncrypto1: mean CRPS=874.413999, n=1680\nRunning sobol_rank_bridge_precision_3109\nBTC    86400 2026-11-08 CRPS=2501.22871 n=2184 s/prompt=0.072\nSOL    86400 2026-11-08 CRPS=4233.90352 n=2184 s/prompt=0.064\nXRP    86400 2026-11-08 CRPS=4757.04026 n=2184 s/prompt=0.062\nXAU    86400 2026-11-08 CRPS=1353.88113 n=2053 s/prompt=0.060\nHYPE   86400 2026-11-08 CRPS=5335.08388 n=2184 s/prompt=0.062\nRunning cal_mix110; budget checked.\nHYPE    3600 2026-10-12 CRPS=905.62250 n=84 s/prompt=0.043\ncrypto24: mean CRPS=4674.905195, n=840\nother24: mean CRPS=1770.577997, n=1344\ncrypto1: mean CRPS=979.034245, n=840\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
