{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_433","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n 'model|seed|hash|source|metadata|elapsed|summary' agent/predict.py && cat agent/results/ml_vol_dev/crypto24_BTC_2026-08-24.json\"","aggregated_output":"4:Answers, with agent/modeling.py, the prompts the validator scored in the --days before --eval-end,\n13:rank, and any window of the snapshot, including before the bundle's span. Compare models on the same\n18:simulate() rather than stopping the run — your model must tolerate them (drop, never interpolate).\n19:The context spans the CONTEXT_DAYS your modeling.py sets (7 without it), and the days before an\n22:When the snapshot carries an event calendar ($SYNTH_BENCHMARK_CALENDAR), the summary is followed by\n34:scored from (ISSUANCE_LEAD_SECONDS). Ending the context at t would hand the model the answer to\n35:its own first step, and a model tuned that way is optimising a problem it will not be scored on.\n42:import hashlib\n75:import modeling  # noqa: E402  (import after adding AGENT_DIR to sys.path)\n77:# Your modeling.py's CONTEXT_DAYS, read as the verdict and the live miner read it.\n78:CONTEXT_DAYS = context_days_of(modeling)\n191:            modeling.simulate, asset, day, day_times, prices, out_dir,\n264:    global modeling, CONTEXT_DAYS\n301:    ap.add_argument(\"--model-module\", default=\"modeling\", help=\"module in agent/ to evaluate\")\n302:    ap.add_argument(\"--output\", type=Path, help=\"save summary JSON and prompt-level parquet with this prefix\")\n312:    modeling = importlib.import_module(args.model_module)\n313:    CONTEXT_DAYS = context_days_of(modeling)\n389:        result.summary.update({\"model_module\": args.model_module, \"asset\": args.asset,\n390:                               \"model_variant\": getattr(modeling, \"VARIANT\", None),\n391:                               \"model_source_sha256\": hashlib.sha256(Path(modeling.__file__).read_bytes()).hexdigest(),\n400:        result.summary.update({\"benchmark_seed\": os.environ.get(\"SYNTH_BENCHMARK_SEED\", \"20261108\"),\n404:        print(f\"summary (CONTEXT_DAYS {CONTEXT_DAYS}):\", result.summary)\n407:            args.output.with_suffix(\".json\").write_text(json.dumps(result.summary, indent=2, default=str) + \"\\n\")\n{\n  \"miner_name\": \"campaign\",\n  \"miner_id\": 999,\n  \"num_prompts\": 84,\n  \"mean_crps\": 3634.9161373915786,\n  \"realized_points_expected\": 24276,\n  \"realized_points_scored\": 24276,\n  \"realized_coverage\": 1.0,\n  \"model_module\": \"ml_models\",\n  \"asset\": \"BTC\",\n  \"model_variant\": \"ml_vol\",\n  \"model_source_sha256\": \"f3f59ab4bbd643827b4a70690cc01e788cc7db9a6d34101451871933d0dc8232\",\n  \"time_length\": 86400,\n  \"num_simulations\": 1000,\n  \"eval_end\": \"2026-08-24\",\n  \"days\": 7,\n  \"context_days\": 7,\n  \"generation_seconds\": 7.99530922199483,\n  \"seconds_per_prompt\": 0.0951822526427956,\n  \"total_seconds\": 9.629029001996969,\n  \"field_times\": false,\n  \"stride\": 1,\n  \"cadence_minutes\": 120,\n  \"offset_minutes\": 17\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
