comparison reverses; report.md\n  preserves these qualifications and the unsuccessful experiments.\n\n  Final release audit: 72 serving cases pass, including three real days and\n  internal/trailing gaps, with XGBoost imports blocked; maximum call 0.362382 seconds. Calendar/count audit:\n  24 cases pass, including preserved-mtime refreshes and counts 1/3/999/1000/1001.\n  Required serving artifacts are committed (19315018 bytes); all 12 retained\n  chronological volatility forests load using NumPy. No serving XGBoost, network or GPU\n  dependency. Prices and fitted labels use only the supplied snapshot through\n  2026-11-08. Event dates use only the supplied calendar. No sparse-context prior,\n  temporal volatility state, zero-return atom, or covariance modification retained.\n  Initial harness nomination failed because XGBoost was unavailable. This commit\n  removes that runtime dependency through an exact forest export; 49152 feature\n  rows across all 24 archived original forests match XGBoost bit for bit.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
